      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAIL MONEY (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (25.13) at this track. The form out of his last race has been franked. Tough to beat if on-song. JOLANNA (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 435m behind Fall And Glimmer (25.19) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Cannot be taken lightly. DIRTY NALA (7) racing well without winning and has a strong place strike-rate, with five minors from six starts. Was in the placings again last time finishing third (23.33) at Warragul. Well-placed to take this out. RHODUS (8) is a newcomer from the Leslie Hughes kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Respect any moves in the market.",
